/P 231 0 R
/T (The performance of AI-based evaluation systems is typically measured using metrics such as accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score for text recognition, along with correlation metrics to compare automated scores with human evaluation. These evaluation methods help in assessing both the technical performance and practical usability of the system. )
/E (The performance of AI-based evaluation systems is typically measured using metrics such as accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score for text recognition, along with correlation metrics to compare automated scores with human evaluation. These evaluation methods help in assessing both the technical performance and practical usability of the system. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
