727 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (Data representation plays a crucial role in the AI Handwritten Evaluation System as it determines how handwritten input is processed and understood by the model. The system converts handwritten images into structured digital data that can be analyzed efficiently. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
728 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (Initially, handwritten answer scripts are captured as image data. These images are then preprocessed and passed through OCR, which converts them into machine-readable text. This text is further transformed into numerical representations using techniques such as tokenization, word embeddings, or vectorization, enabling the system to process and analyze the content. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
729 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (For effective evaluation, the textual data is represented in a structured format where important features such as keywords, sentence structure, and semantic meaning are captured. NLP models use these representations to compare student answers with model answers and assess their relevance and correctness. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
