2812 0 obj
<<
/Title (Evaluation of such systems is typically performed using metrics like accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score for text recognition, along with grading consistency and correlation with human evaluation for answer assessment. User feedback and real-world testing are also essential to validate system performance and usability.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2810 0 R
/Next 2814 0 R
>>
endobj
2813 0 obj
<<
