2814 0 obj
<<
/Title (In conclusion, the literature shows a clear evolution from basic rule-based systems to advanced AI-driven approaches for automated evaluation. The integration of OCR and NLP techniques has enabled the development of intelligent systems capable of evaluating handwritten answers with improved accuracy and efficiency. The proposed AI Handwritten Evaluation System builds upon these advancements to provide a scalable, reliable, and unbiased solution for modern educational assessment.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2812 0 R
/Next 2816 0 R
>>
endobj
