/Title (Recent studies have focused on integrating OCR and NLP into a unified framework to create intelligent systems capable of evaluating handwritten responses. This integration allows the system to first convert handwritten text into digital form and then analyze the content for grading. Such systems aim to replicate human evaluation by considering both the correctness and quality of answers.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2816 0 R
/Next 2820 0 R
>>
endobj
