2820 0 obj
<<
/Title (Despite these advancements, several challenges remain in the field. Variability in handwriting styles, poor image quality, and incomplete or ambiguous answers can affect recognition and evaluation accuracy. Additionally, ensuring fairness and avoiding bias in automated grading systems is a critical concern. Researchers are exploring techniques such as explainable AI \(XAI\) to make evaluation decisions more transparent and trustworthy.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2818 0 R
/Next 2822 0 R
>>
